{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_038_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:86b94d834d6a3435e0e5c165a03581efe7c5244b785c0af4008074b3c52a88d9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de6f8bbf689729da43c031355d8f248a3837f0673dc38a056a84e719c26373c0",
      "text": "（来得挺早的啊……\n离跟圆城寺先生约好的时间还有一会儿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731045c7c571d3120e77f1b242777b1c1a6e9ae8271756e53c93c4a191a3b8d6",
      "text": "（去事务所里等吧。\n……那是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb0b8086ee1db4e7fdc50e239595dd2d93d9c6ed7b54bd6ba44a1893c967c5ce",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af4fc0fe6225f331bdc2524b8a5e163505312c347e9af039733d2f889e2f35e8",
      "text": "武、武先生！辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5db462d6b54237915a681ea11b47219b304d874b41a833e917ccac41c6a6d3b",
      "text": "……？\n制作人也是要去事务所吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afbaef5c9d631f77b3b96f9ea250388bb41135a725f061eb505e8344dab40162",
      "text": "是的。我正好办完事回来。\n武先生也是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b3f54edd535fa0e67900750fdec59be780048eb18e8b4b3d642f6cfb07c8c7",
      "text": "嗯。圆城寺先生叫我过来的。\n说是到了事务所再跟我说具体是什么事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aafcb3aba93f1b826ba538324e5f4c625df4857a03061ffde45914b8e382476",
      "text": "你听说什么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:931c5638b8ad6ea443ca0835b043b500d8df96336e82c9a16902e36811a914dd",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n我什么都没……啊，不好意思稍等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61fdb55ded45f83c618bb1e8a56acb991ea287067514db7ff71ecfff8259b584",
      "text": "哦，师父发LINK来了。我瞧瞧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84ac8d3ef163d8f956f29d89419833776d7737ee8cd41c1948a0f94a98b94e4c",
      "text": "……“武先生已经到附近了，\n我稍微拖延一下时间”吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a37cc913c3dbcd20474c93d449b33c3c4f2e3f88de397b129c9a267970413a4f",
      "text": "那可帮大忙了！趁着师父拖延时间的\n空当，我再把炸鸡块复炸一遍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28f700f2e64d6f65b24a2fe4ffff8bc8cc1511c97552da408b298b2f76837a24",
      "text": "（这样暂时就没问题了。\n蛋糕的保冷剂也还能撑一阵子……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe67454c24b3578eb216bfe9c6a1ae74bb075b3c4509664c41bdbf43dc383396",
      "text": "让您久等了。武先生，如果时间方便的话，\n去事务所之前要不要一起在这附近散散步？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_d:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e113172e48cc0892dc38094b7af1b790b591f5835b34d6a55a0723e98001073",
      "text": "我无所谓。正好在犯愁怎么打发时间，\n来得正好。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
